    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.poster.avif?t=1753846845\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.webm?t=1753846845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.mp4?t=1753846845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00b7 Lost in the Silent World of Snow \u00b7</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming auto-merge strategy board game \u2014 featuring chime sounds, water droplets, and lots and lots of snowflakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/ea96f3f0827898190f1d2b4b9f94ce2b.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You advance across a vast, white snowfield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thin ray of sunlight pierces through the gray cloud layer, and cold air fills your nostrils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing here, only endlessly falling snowflakes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----Is there really nothing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/40f91402a0c2e3ddf2ced3be537126c6.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Minimalist chessboard with falling snow animation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sound effects that promote meditation, relaxation, and sleep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing color tones and sound effects across levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 progressively challenging levels -\u00a0from day to dusk to night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 collectible\u00a0snowfield animal photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for infinite challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/b04d9f83954daca7010650c470d768a8.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on empty grid squares to place snowflakes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two adjacent snowflakes automatically merge into a larger one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water droplets can be used to melt excess snowflakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create target snowflakes to complete levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/da81660f2dbac02338f6598e77d2dbf3.webp?t=1753846845\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.poster.avif?t=1753846845\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.webm?t=1753846845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/7c818391388fc877116a701d88ff19f9.mp4?t=1753846845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00b7 Lost in the Silent World of Snow \u00b7</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming auto-merge strategy board game \u2014 featuring chime sounds, water droplets, and lots and lots of snowflakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/ea96f3f0827898190f1d2b4b9f94ce2b.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You advance across a vast, white snowfield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thin ray of sunlight pierces through the gray cloud layer, and cold air fills your nostrils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing here, only endlessly falling snowflakes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----Is there really nothing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/40f91402a0c2e3ddf2ced3be537126c6.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Minimalist chessboard with falling snow animation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sound effects that promote meditation, relaxation, and sleep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing color tones and sound effects across levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 progressively challenging levels -\u00a0from day to dusk to night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 collectible\u00a0snowfield animal photos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for infinite challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/b04d9f83954daca7010650c470d768a8.avif?t=1753846845\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on empty grid squares to place snowflakes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two adjacent snowflakes automatically merge into a larger one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water droplets can be used to melt excess snowflakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create target snowflakes to complete levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/da81660f2dbac02338f6598e77d2dbf3.webp?t=1753846845\" width=35 height=35 /></span></p>",
